WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.800
A swordfish approaches small fish. The overhead camera stays fixed.

00:03.800 --> 00:06.500
The head and rigid bill sweep left, then right.

00:06.500 --> 00:10.400
One fish is visibly impaled crosswise on the bill. A close-up shows the same fish. This is a dramatization; swordfish are described as slashing prey sideways.

00:10.400 --> 00:11.200
The fish slides off the tip of the bill.

00:11.200 --> 00:12.800
The released fish moves to the mouth and is consumed.

00:12.800 --> 00:14.000
The swordfish continues swimming. This is an illustrative AI reconstruction.
